    {
      "id": "31beb6466aaf-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Which digit will appear on the face opposite to the face with number 4?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which digit will appear on the face opposite to the face with number 4?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/18/02/DMRC%20JE%20FT5_LR_3.PNG\" style=\"height:142px; width:279px\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2 or 3",
          "html": "2 or 3"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Taking dice positions:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Pooja.S_12-05-21_Savita_D16.png\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 129px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>3 are common, moving clockwise from the common number:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Pooja.S_12-05-21_Savita_D17.png\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 166px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Pair of opposite numbers:</p>\n\n<p>3 - 4</p>\n\n<p>2 - 6</p>\n\n<p>1 - 5</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">So, the opposite number&nbsp;to 4&nbsp;is 3.</span></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;3&quot;.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/18/02/DMRC%20JE%20FT5_LR_3.PNG",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Pooja.S_12-05-21_Savita_D16.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Pooja.S_12-05-21_Savita_D17.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31beb6466aaf-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Four position of the same dice are shown. Select the number that will be on the face opposite to the one showing &lsquo;3&rsquo;",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Four position of the same dice are shown. Select the number that will be on the face opposite to the one showing &lsquo;3&rsquo;</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/05/F1_S.Y_3.4.20_Pallavi_D%208.png\" style=\"width: 358px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>4 is adjacent to 2 and 3 in the first position of the dice.</p>\n\n<p>3 is adjacent to 4 and 6 in the second position of the dice.</p>\n\n<p>3 is adjacent to 6 and 1 in the third position of the dice.</p>\n\n<p>3 is adjacent to 1 and 4 in the fourth position of the dice.</p>\n\n<p>The only number left is 5.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, 3 is opposite to 5.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/05/F1_S.Y_3.4.20_Pallavi_D%208.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
