      "question": "Which of the cubes in the given options can't be made from the below unfolded cube?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which of the cubes in the given options can&#39;t be made from the below unfolded cube?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/18/04/Cube_Dice_15.PNG\" /></p>\n",
