      "solution": "<p>4th&nbsp;cube is not possible from unfolded cube as 6 star fold will be opposite to the one star figure.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/18/04/Cube_Dice_19.PNG\" style=\"height:77px; width:82px\" /></p>\nHence, <strong>4<sup>th</sup> cube</strong> cannot be made from the unfolded cube.",
