      "questionHtml": "<p>Choose a box which is similar to the box formed from the given sheet of paper?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F1_Taniya_14.12.20_Pallavi_D15.png\" style=\"width: 159px; height: 120px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F1_Taniya_14.12.20_Pallavi_D16.png\" style=\"width: 237px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\n",
