      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F1_Taniya_14.12.20_Pallavi_D17.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Opposite faces</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F1_Taniya_14.12.20_Pallavi_D18.png\" style=\"width: 156px; height: 189px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>So, all given figure are possible.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, figure 1, 2 and 3 is similar to the box formed from the given sheet of paper.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, all <strong>correct is the answer.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
