    {
      "id": "31beb6466aaf-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "A cube having a side of 5 cm is painted yellow on all the faces and then cut into smaller cubes of 1 cm each. How many cubes will have only two faces painted?",
      "questionHtml": "<span style=\" line-height: 115%;  background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">A cube having a side of 5 cm is painted yellow on all the faces and then cut into smaller cubes of 1 cm each. How many cubes will have only two faces painted?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "36",
          "html": "36"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "27",
          "html": "27"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "54",
          "html": "54"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">A cube having a side of 5 cm is painted yellow on all the faces and then cut into smaller cubes of 1 cm each.<o:p></o:p></span><u1:p></u1:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">So, n = 5 (n is the number of divisions on the face of an undivided cube)<u1:p></u1:p></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Shortcut Trick</u></span></strong></span><u1:p></u1:p></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\" \">For a cube of side n &times; n &times; n painted on all side which is uniformly cut into smaller cubes of dimension 1 &times; 1 &times; 1,</span></strong><u1:p></u1:p><span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\" \">Number of cubes with no face colored = (n - 2)</span></strong><strong><sup><span style=\" \">3</span></sup></strong><u1:p></u1:p><span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\" \">Number of cubes with one face colored = 6(n - 2)</span></strong><strong><sup><span style=\" \">2</span></sup></strong><u1:p></u1:p><span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\" \">Number of cubes with two faces colored = 12(n - 2)</span></strong><u1:p></u1:p><span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\" \">Number of cubes with three faces colored = 8(Always)</span></strong><u1:p></u1:p><span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">Number of cubes with only two faces painted = 12(n - 2)</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">= 12(5 - 2)</span>&nbsp;= 12(3)&nbsp;= 36<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"  background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Hence,&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&quot;36&quot;</span></strong>&nbsp;is the correct answer.</span><span style=\" \"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
