      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the dice that can be formed by folding the given sheet along the lines.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D9.png\" style=\"width: 109px; height: 145px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D10.png\" style=\"width: 346px; height: 106px;\" /></p>\n",
