      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The faces opposite to each other is shown below:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D11.png\" style=\"width: 136px; height: 159px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D12.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" />&nbsp;&rarr; Can&#39;t be formed as 2 cannot be to the right side of 4 and 5 as 2&#39;s position is to the left of 4 and 5 in the unfolded dice.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D13.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 82px;\" />&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&rarr;&nbsp;Can&#39;t be formed as 6&nbsp;cannot be to the left&nbsp;side of 4 and 5 as 6&#39;s position is to the right of 4 and 5 in the unfolded dice.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D14.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 82px;\" />&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&rarr; Can be formed.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F2_Savita_SSC_8-9-22_D15.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" />&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&rarr; Can&#39;t be formed as 4 and 8 are opposite faces.</span></p>\n\n<p>Hence, &#39;<strong><span style=\"\">Only C</span></strong>&#39; is the correct answer.</p>\n",
