      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Given:</p>\n\n<p>A solid cube is made using 64 small cubes</p>\n\n<p>N = 64</p>\n\n<p>n = 4</p>\n\n<p>Thus the number of small cubes whose two sides are seen = (n - 2)&nbsp;&times; 12</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (4 - 2)&nbsp;&times; 12</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 2&nbsp;&times; 12</p>\n\n<p><strong>&rArr; 24</strong></p>\n",
