      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/naykadiceachaoia%3B.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 92px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/pagladeewanananietjereir.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 91px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Using above these two dice opposite faces are as follows:</p>\n\n<p>2&nbsp;&rarr; 2</p>\n\n<p>3&nbsp;&rarr; 5</p>\n\n<p>1&nbsp;&rarr; 6</p>\n\n<p>So, the number on the opposite to the face showing &#39;1&#39; is <strong>6</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>6</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
